        "content": "The PMI hovering near 50 tells us what our customers are already telling us\u2014IT budgets are in a holding pattern. We're seeing more scrutiny on SaaS stack optimization and longer procurement cycles, but enterprise tech investments haven't frozen yet. Staying agile on our vendor roadmap feels prudent until we get clearer signals.",
